    "body": "Screenshot is probably a good idea. Here's the extended Bash behavior I was talking about:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"316\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2019-08-18 at 10 12 23 PM\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/714/63240614-4df46c80-c205-11e9-973e-4d37e6fef078.png\">\r\n\r\nOne quirk I didn't mention is if every job in the pipeline succeeds it doesn't show the pipe status, even if the overall job fails (due to negation), so `[(1)]` is possible output. I'm not committed to this particular behavior though, it just seemed like a good idea at the time.",
